# Everything page: vision collage

## Canonical name

Call this layout **vision collage**.

That is the Aug 26 pattern. Use that term with Diana and in code/comments so it does not get reinvented as “cards,” “shot-cards,” “freeplace squares,” or “polaroids.”

## What vision collage is

- A day card’s pursuits view uses a `.vision-board` / `.vision-hero` collage
- Each piece is a **section** (`.vision-tile`), not a card
- Photo is **full-bleed** (`object-fit`/background cover edge to edge)
- Title overlays the photo (bottom-left italic serif), never a black footer bar or half-card sidebar
- Sections sit in a collage grid with small gutters

Reference day: **`2026-08-26`** in `everything.html` (class `vision-collage-day`).

## Hard rules

1. **Every new Everything day from Aug 26 onward** uses **vision collage** unless Diana explicitly asks for something else.
2. Never put proof screenshots / pursuits into `sec-card` / `shot-card` / freeplace square cards on those days.
3. Screenshots Diana sends go **unaltered** into vision-tile photos (`--tile-photo`).
4. Mark those day blocks with class **`vision-collage-day`** so shared CSS/JS apply.
5. Do not convert a vision-collage day into `freeplace-day` or auto-clone unrelated cards onto it.

## Not vision collage

- Small floating cards with black bottom bars
- Freeplace absolute 248×248 squares
- “Shot-card” tickets with title footers under the image

If a new day appears in that wrong form, fix it to **vision collage** immediately — do not wait to be reminded.
